cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "CDD-AVDL: Audio-Visual Deep Learning for Depression Diagnosis"
abstract: "Reference implementation of CDD-AVDL, an audio-visual depression diagnosis model that fuses wav2vec2/AST audio features with OpenGraphAU/MLSTM-FCN visual features through three convolution-layer fusion stages."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/cstcood/CDD_AVDL"
